{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSTextInput","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Controls"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"text":"Layout","anchor":"Layout","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Text input is based on several configurable UI elements:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"label"}]},{"type":"text","text":": It is used to describe the purpose of the input."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"In some UI contexts, especially when space is limited or when the input is part of a compact layout (search bars, filters, inline forms), the label can be hidden."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However, hiding the label should only be done if the purpose of the input remains clear thanks to a placeholder or contextual icon"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and if the label is still accessible to screen readers"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Hiding a label is a design choice that must balance visual simplicity and clarity of intent, without compromising inclusiveness or form guidance."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"placeholder"}]},{"type":"text","text":": if the text of the text input is empty a placeholder provides a hint or guidance inside the field to suggest expected input."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A prefix and a suffix can be added to give more context."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"leading icon"}]},{"type":"text","text":": it helps indicate the purpose of the input (magnifying glass for search, envelope for email, phone device for phone number)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Only use a leading icon if it adds clear functional or contextual value."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"trailing action"}]},{"type":"text","text":": it is used to provide actions related to the field: clear input, toggle password visibility, open a date picker, etc."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Can also indicate status or feedback (error checkmark, loading spinner)."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Outlined style","anchor":"Outlined-style","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"By "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"default"}]},{"type":"text","text":", the input is with a subtle background fill and invisible bottom border, creating a softer and more contained look."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Best suited for dense layouts or to enhance visibility."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"outlined"}]},{"type":"text","text":", the text input is a minimalist design with a transparent background and a visible stroke outlining the field."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This style may be interesting for contexts other than form pages:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When inputs need to feel lightweight and unobtrusive"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In a header (search field)"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In a selection\/filtering feature in a product catalog"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["   \/\/ An outlined text input","   OUDSTextInput(label: \"Label\", text: $text, isOutlined: true)","","   \/\/ With a localizable and a bundle","   OUDSTextInput(LocalizedStringKey(\"label_wording\"), bundle: Bundle.module, text: $text)"]},{"text":"Rounded layout","anchor":"Rounded-layout","type":"heading","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Text input can have rounded layouts to be favored in more emotional, immersive contexts or those tied to specific visual identities."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For standard or business-oriented journeys, keep the default corners."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This evolution addresses the need for flexibility in adapting the design to some brand contexts."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To activate the rounded corner behavior, set to true the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hasRoundedTextInputs"},{"type":"text","text":" values of the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Tuning"},{"type":"text","text":" object"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in your theme configuration (if the theme exposes this property at init)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Some themes do not have this flexibility like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SoshTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WireframeTheme"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Status","anchor":"Status","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Five status are proposed for all layouts:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"default (by default)"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Default neutral appearance, whether empty or filled."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It allows users to click, focus, and type freely without restrictions."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"error"}]},{"type":"text","text":": The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"error"},{"type":"text","text":" status indicates that the user input does not meet validation rules or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"expected formatting. It provides immediate visual feedback, typically through a red border,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"error icon, and a clear, accessible error message positioned below the input. The error messages replaces the helper text."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"loading"}]},{"type":"text","text":": The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"loading"},{"type":"text","text":" state indicates that the system is processing or retrieving data"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"related to the text entered. A progress indicator appears to inform the user that an action is in progress."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"readOnly"}]},{"type":"text","text":" :The"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"readOnly"},{"type":"text","text":", lets the text visible but not editable"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"disabled"}]},{"type":"text","text":": In "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"disabled"},{"type":"text","text":" status, the field is non-interactive and grayed out to indicate it cannot be changed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Note the SwiftUI "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View.disabled()"},{"type":"text","text":" is ignored."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Helpers","anchor":"Helpers","type":"heading","level":2},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Helper text"}]},{"type":"text","text":":  A supporting text conveys additional information about the input field,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"such as how it will be used. It should ideally only take up a single line, though may wrap"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to multiple lines if required, and be either persistently visible or visible only on focus."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Helper link"}]},{"type":"text","text":": If the helper text is not sufficient, it’s possible to offer the user"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an additional help link (the link can be external or open a modal)."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Accessibility considerations","anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"By default no haptics are done by the component for the trailing action."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However you should think about cases wher you will have to make the devices vibrates."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You can refer to the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/developer.apple.com\/design\/human-interface-guidelines\/playing-haptics","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Mandatory field indication","anchor":"Mandatory-field-indication","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If all fields are mandatory (several fields present): display the message “All fields are mandatory” at the top of your formular."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Do not use an asterisk at the end of each field label, nor the word “mandatory.”"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If not all fields are mandatory (several fields present): display the message “All fields marked with an * are mandatory” at the top of your formular."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Use an asterisk (*) at the end of each mandatory field label, and ensures this is well vocalized."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"UI rendering of the asterisk must be done with "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"bold font weight"}]},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"negative content color"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (red on light backgrounds)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the mention “(optional)” at the end of each optional field label. Note that this rule is not systematic, it remains an option, to be used if needed."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If there is only one field in the formular, or if the mandatory nature is obvious (such as login\/password),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no mention is necessary since the fields are essential to the formular’s functionality."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Rich text","anchor":"Rich-text","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Rich text can be used for error and helper texts."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Strong text can be used sparingly to highlight key information within the content."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"No other text styles should be used."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Underlined text must not be applied manually (e.g. in error message), as it is commonly associated with hyperlinks and may mislead users."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Code samples","anchor":"Code-samples","type":"heading","level":2},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ The text to display and edit","    @State var text: String = \"\"","","    \/\/ Empty text and no placeholder","    OUDSTextInput(label: \"Email\", text: $text)","","    \/\/ Empty text with placeholder and suffix","    OUDSTextInput(label: \"Email\", text: $text, placeholder: \"firstName.lastName\", suffix: \"@orange.com\")","","    \/\/ Empty text with prefix and suffix","    OUDSTextInput(label: \"Email\", text: $text, prefix: \"Distance\", suffix: \"km\")","","    \/\/ Add a leading icon for more context","    OUDSTextInput(label: \"Email\", text: $text, placeholder: \"firstName.lastName\", suffix: \"@orange.com\",","                  leadingImage: OUDSImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"envelope\")))","","    \/\/ Add a leading icon displayed as raw image (not tinted)","    OUDSTextInput(label: \"Brand\", text: $text,","                  leadingImage: OUDSImage(asset: Image(\"ic_brand\"), renderingMode: .original))","","    \/\/ Flip the leading icon for RTL layouts using OUDSImage.flipped","    OUDSTextInput(label: \"Label\", text: $text,","                  leadingImage: OUDSImage(asset: Image(\"ic_arrow\"), flipped: layoutDirection == .rightToLeft))","","    \/\/ Add a trailing button with local image named \"ic_cross\" for additional action","    let trailingAction = OUDSTextInput.TrailingAction(image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(\"ic_cross\")), actionHint: \"Delete\") { text = \"\" }","    OUDSTextInput(label: \"Email\", text: $text, trailingAction: trailingAction)","","    \/\/ With helper text","    OUDSTextInput(label: \"Email\",","                  text: $text,","                  placeholder: \"firstName.lastName\",","                  suffix: \"@orange.com\",","                  helperText: \"The email will be automatically completed with @orange.com\")","","    \/\/ With helper link","    @Environment(\\.openURL) private var openUrl","","    let helperLink = OUDSTextInput.HelperLink(text: \"Helper Link\") {","       openUrl.callAsFunction(url)","    }","","    OUDSTextInput(label: \"Label\", text: $text, placeholder: \"Placeholder\", helperLink: helperLink)"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you need to flip your leading icon for RTL, use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"flipped"},{"type":"text","text":" property of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSImage","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["    @Environment(\\.layoutDirection) var layoutDirection","","    OUDSTextInput(label: \"Label\", text: $text,","                  leadingImage: OUDSImage(asset: Image(\"ic_arrow\"), flipped: layoutDirection == .rightToLeft))"]},{"text":"Design documentation","anchor":"Design-documentation","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-text-input","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Themes rendering","anchor":"Themes-rendering","type":"heading","level":2},{"text":"Orange","anchor":"Orange","type":"heading","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_textInput_Orange"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Orange Compact","anchor":"Orange-Compact","type":"heading","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_textInput_OrangeCompact"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Sosh","anchor":"Sosh","type":"heading","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_textInput_Sosh"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Wireframe","anchor":"Wireframe","type":"heading","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_textInput_Wireframe"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"aside","name":"Version","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"1.4.1 (Figma component design version)"}]}],"style":"note"},{"type":"aside","name":"Since","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"0.20.0"}]}],"style":"note"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"title":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextInput\/Helperlink","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextInput\/TrailingAction"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Structures"},{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextInput\/init(_:tableName:bundle:text:placeholder:prefix:suffix:leadingImage:trailingAction:helperText:helperLink:isOutlined:constrainedMaxWidth:status:)-6fxq4","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextInput\/init(_:tableName:bundle:text:placeholder:prefix:suffix:leadingImage:trailingAction:helperText:helperLink:isOutlined:constrainedMaxWidth:status:)-926rh","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextInput\/init(label:text:placeholder:prefix:suffix:leadingImage:trailingAction:helperText:helperLink:isOutlined:constrainedMaxWidth:status:)-2tesf","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextInput\/init(label:text:placeholder:prefix:suffix:leadingImage:trailingAction:helperText:helperLink:isOutlined:constrainedMaxWidth:status:)-6qaat"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextInput\/body"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"title":"Enumerations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextInput\/Status"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Enumerations"},{"title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextInput\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextInput\/View-Implementations"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Text input is a UI element that allows to enter, edit, or select single-line textual data.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Text input is one of the most fundamental form elements used to capture user input such as names, emails, passwords, or search queries.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It provides a visual and interactive affordance for text entry while supporting labels, placeholders, icons, descriptions, and validation feedback.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextInput"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudstextinput"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"symbolKind":"struct","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSTextInput","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents13OUDSTextInputV","title":"OUDSTextInput","platforms":[{"unavailable":false,"name":"iOS","beta":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false},{"unavailable":false,"name":"macOS","beta":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","deprecated":false},{"unavailable":false,"name":"visionOS","beta":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","deprecated":false}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSTextInput","kind":"identifier"}]},"references":{"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSTextInput":{"abstract":[{"text":"Text input is a UI element that allows to enter, edit, or select single-line textual data.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Text input is one of the most fundamental form elements used to capture user input such as names, emails, passwords, or search queries.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It provides a visual and interactive affordance for text entry while supporting labels, placeholders, icons, descriptions, and validation feedback.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudstextinput","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSTextInput"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextInput","type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSTextInput"}],"title":"OUDSTextInput","kind":"symbol"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSTextInput/init(label:text:placeholder:prefix:suffix:leadingImage:trailingAction:helperText:helperLink:isOutlined:constrainedMaxWidth:status:)-2tesf":{"title":"init(label:text:placeholder:prefix:suffix:leadingImage:trailingAction:helperText:helperLink:isOutlined:constrainedMaxWidth:status:)","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudstextinput\/init(label:text:placeholder:prefix:suffix:leadingimage:trailingaction:helpertext:helperlink:isoutlined:constrainedmaxwidth:status:)-2tesf","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextInput\/init(label:text:placeholder:prefix:suffix:leadingImage:trailingAction:helperText:helperLink:isOutlined:constrainedMaxWidth:status:)-2tesf","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"label","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"text","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI7BindingV","text":"Binding","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"placeholder","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"prefix","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"suffix","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"leadingImage","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14OUDSComponents9OUDSImageV","text":"OUDSImage","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"trailingAction","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14OUDSComponents13OUDSTextInputV","text":"OUDSTextInput","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14OUDSComponents13OUDSTextInputV14TrailingActionV","text":"TrailingAction","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"helperText","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation16AttributedStringV","text":"AttributedString","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"helperLink","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14OUDSComponents13OUDSTextInputV","text":"OUDSTextInput","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14OUDSComponents13OUDSTextInputV10HelperlinkV","text":"Helperlink","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isOutlined","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"constrainedMaxWidth","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"status","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14OUDSComponents13OUDSTextInputV","text":"OUDSTextInput","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14OUDSComponents13OUDSTextInputV6StatusO","text":"Status","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Creates a text input with a rich attributed helper text.","type":"text"}]},"component_textInput_Orange":{"alt":"A text input component in light and dark modes with Orange theme","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_textInput_Orange.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"type":"image","identifier":"component_textInput_Orange"},"component_textInput_Wireframe":{"alt":"A text input component in light and dark modes with Wireframe theme","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_textInput_Wireframe.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"type":"image","identifier":"component_textInput_Wireframe"},"doc://OUDSComponents/7SwiftUI4ViewP":{"title":"SwiftUICore.View","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSTextInput/init(label:text:placeholder:prefix:suffix:leadingImage:trailingAction:helperText:helperLink:isOutlined:constrainedMaxWidth:status:)-6qaat":{"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"label"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"text"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Binding","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI7BindingV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"placeholder"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"prefix"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"external